      <h1><span lang="de">Danke.</span><span lang="en">Thank you.</span><span lang="fr">Merci.</span><span lang="es">Gracias.</span><span lang="zh">谢谢。</span><span lang="hi">धन्यवाद।</span><span lang="ar">شكرًا لك.</span></h1>

